why The Water Totem that lets you place water totems, and Healing Stream Totem with it.

# Call of Water for Alliance (Dwarf) Shamans, Forever's own chain (94494 to
# 94505): Eldrun Stormbreaker in Ironforge -> Norric Lochthane in Loch Modan
# -> Hervdana Saegrund in the Wetlands, who sends you for three waterskins
# (below her cave, Stonewatch Falls in Redridge, the lake of Astranaar in
# Ashenvale) -> Norric (Water Sapta) -> Stendel's Pond in Westfall -> Norric,
# who teaches Healing Stream Totem and gives the Water Totem.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and objects.json for givers, enders and the
# Forgotten Shrine; Forever's quest data
# (quest 94494 and the chain's series)
# for the order, the fill places (their objective texts) and the rewards
# (94501: Water Sapta; 94505: Healing Stream Totem and the Water Totem).
# Places the data does not have:
# - The waterskins have no fill object in the data. Their points are the
#   places the objectives name: Hervdana's cave (her own spawn), the Murloc
#   Nightcrawlers at the foot of Stonewatch Falls (npc 544's spawns) and
#   Astranaar (its flight master's spot; fill the skin in the lake around the
#   town).
# - The data places the Corrupt Minor Manifestation of Water (5894) and the
#   Minor Manifestation of Water (5895) only by the Brazier of Everfount in
#   Silverpine Forest, where the Horde chain meets them. 94502's text sends
#   you to Stendel's Pond outside Moonbrook, and 94503's to the Minor
#   Manifestation "in Westfall", called forth at the Forgotten Shrine: both
#   are pinned to the shrine (45.6,59.9), so lint warns that the two npcs have
#   no known spawn there.
# Water Sapta (94616): Norric replaces a lost Water Sapta while 94502 is
# open (a conditional step).
# Gotchas from Forever's quest notes: one player lost the red waterskin on
# filling it without credit (abandon and retake from Hervdana); 94503's
# spirit leaves if you walk off (abandon and retake it at the shrine).
# The Alliance leveling guides leave this chain out (see
# forever/alliance/dwarf-gnome/01-dun-morogh's header): Hervdana's three
# waterskins send you back to the Wetlands three times.
# Beta capped at 30: the chain was not played; it follows the data above.

step Eldrun Stormbreaker
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 20 Eldrun Stormbreaker, the shaman trainer in Ironforge's Mystic Ward, sends you to Norric Lochthane in Loch Modan.
  level 20
  accept 94494                                -- Eldrun Stormbreaker

step Norric Lochthane
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Norric's burrow hut stands on the north-western shore of the loch, below Stonewrought Dam, north of Thelsamar.
  turnin 94494                                -- Norric Lochthane
  accept 94495

step Hervdana Saegrund
  zone Wetlands
  tip Hervdana's family lives in a cave beneath the southern falls of the Wetlands, east of Dun Algaz: not in a town. Through the Algaz tunnel north of Loch Modan, then east off the road.
  turnin 94495                                -- Hervdana Saegrund
  accept 94497

step The brown waterskin
  tip Fill the Unfilled Brown Waterskin at the bottom of the waterfalls below Hervdana's cave, where the fresh water meets the brackish. Dark Iron dwarves roam near the falls.
  collect 265734 quest 94497.1 @65.8,76.5     -- Full Brown Waterskin

step Hervdana Saegrund
  turnin 94497                                -- Hervdana Saegrund
  accept 94499

step The red waterskin
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Stonewatch Falls pour out of Lake Everstill at the east end of Redridge (fly from Ironforge to Lakeshire). Fill the Unfilled Red Waterskin at their foot, where the Murloc Nightcrawlers gather; pull the murlocs off the spot first. If the skin vanishes without counting, abandon the quest and take it again from Hervdana for a new one.
  collect 265748 quest 94499.1 @71.9,60.3     -- Full Red Waterskin

step Hervdana Saegrund
  zone Wetlands
  turnin 94499                                -- Hervdana Saegrund
  accept 94500

step The blue waterskin
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Take the boat from Menethil Harbor to Auberdine (it stops in Southshore on the way), then fly or walk south through Darkshore to Astranaar in Ashenvale. Fill the Unfilled Blue Waterskin in the lake around the town, then the boat back to Menethil.
  collect 265773 quest 94500.1 @34.5,48.0     -- Full Blue Waterskin

step Hervdana Saegrund
  zone Wetlands
  turnin 94500                                -- Hervdana Saegrund
  accept 94501                                -- the Vial of Purest Water, for Norric

step Norric Lochthane
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Back to Norric by Stonewrought Dam with the Vial of Purest Water. He hands you the Water Sapta and the Remaining Drops of Purest Water: keep both for Westfall.
  turnin 94501 reward 6637                    -- Norric Lochthane: your Water Sapta
  accept 94502

step Lost the Water Sapta?
  when onquest 94502
  when !has 6637
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Only if the Water Sapta is gone from your bags: Norric gives you another before you leave for Westfall.
  accept 94616
  turnin 94616                                -- Norric Lochthane: a new Water Sapta

step Stendel's Pond
  zone Westfall
  tip Fly to Sentinel Hill and head south to Moonbrook: Stendel's Pond and the Forgotten Shrine lie just north of it. Drink the Water Sapta by the shrine to see the Corrupt Minor Manifestation of Water (level 22, Frost Shock and Frost Nova; one spawn, back three minutes after a kill), defeat it for its bracers (always dropped), then place them and the Remaining Drops of Purest Water on the Forgotten Shrine (this, not Norric, ends the quest). Click the shrine again: the Minor Manifestation of Water rises beside it; speak to it before you walk off (if it is gone, abandon and take the quest again at the shrine). It gives you the Shard of Water.
  use 6637 quest 94502.1 @45.6,59.9           -- Water Sapta
  collect 7812 quest 94502.1 @45.6,59.9       -- Corrupt Manifestation's Bracers
  turnin 94502                                -- Forgotten Shrine
  accept 94503
  turnin 94503 @46.4,59.2                     -- Minor Manifestation of Water, beside the shrine
  accept 94505 @46.4,59.2

step Norric Lochthane
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Back to Norric with the Shard of Water. Keep the Water Totem in your bags for good: every water totem needs it.
  turnin 94505 reward 5177                    -- Norric Lochthane: Healing Stream Totem and your Water Totem
